 data=[('Understand','We begin with your vision, the site, its surroundings and how the space will be used.'),('Plan','Materials, planting, budget and maintenance needs shape a practical plan for your space.'),('Create','Skilled execution, thoughtful detailing and professional supervision bring the plan to life.'),('Care','Maintenance and enhancement help the landscape remain functional, welcoming and well kept.')]
